143
00:05:38,150 --> 00:05:40,720
Everyone here is very beautiful.

144
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,070
Next is "rich."

145
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:44,490
You could say she's pretty well-off.

146
00:05:44,490 --> 00:05:47,400
Actually more than a little,
