165
00:06:22,030 --> 00:06:24,730
She has her own kind of innocent idealism.

166
00:06:24,730 --> 00:06:27,410
I think that's the charm
of this character.

167
00:06:28,370 --> 00:06:31,530
As for Preem, it should
be "mysterious confidence."

168
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:31,920
[Mysterious Confidence]

169
00:06:32,190 --> 00:06:33,470
She's just...

170
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,060
Not "mysterious." She's openly confident.

171
00:06:36,670 --> 00:06:39,840
In the series, in the series.

172
00:06:36,670 --> 00:06:38,800
[Secretly a Spitfire]

173
