180
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,800
Stay tuned and see for yourselves.

181
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,720
To describe the character Mueanfan,

182
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,130
I choose the phrase "I can't do it."

183
00:07:05,450 --> 00:07:06,130
[I can't do it]

184
