-Yes.

192
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,550
Her charm...

193
00:07:26,990 --> 00:07:28,730
I think what makes this character
charming is

194
00:07:28,730 --> 00:07:31,330
that she has no bad intentions
towards anyone.

195
00:07:31,330 --> 00:07:32,770
And she doesn't realize

196
00:07:32,770 --> 00:07:34,800
she's a bit of a jinx
to everyone around her.

197
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,770
She probably really didn't realize it.

198
00:07:35,770 --> 00:07:37,000
She didn't realize it.

199
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,370
She doesn't know at all, because she...

200
00:07:38,370 --> 00:07:40,200
Hey, but the charm of this character

201
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,409
should lie in the way she speaks.

202
00:07:41,409 --> 00:07:44,400
-She's really good at talking people into things.
-Yes, the way she speaks.

203
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:47,130
She knows how to make everything
sound so convincing.

204
00:07:47,130 --> 00:07:49,760
No spoilers. Wait for the main feature.

205
00:07:50,930 --> 00:07:53,110
She's very good at talking,
but just because she can't do it herself.

206
00:07:53,110 --> 00:07:56,400
I think her charm, as Meena just said,

207
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:58,290
