218
00:08:20,250 --> 00:08:23,040
and her care for the people around her.

219
00:08:23,570 --> 00:08:25,160
The next question is:

220
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:27,640
What aspects of your character

221
00:08:25,590 --> 00:08:31,000
[Actor vs. Character]

222
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:31,000
