from your real-life self?

223
00:08:32,370 --> 00:08:35,039
Wow, there are very few similarities.

224
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:37,480
But there are many differences.

225
00:08:36,929 --> 00:08:39,710
[Simply put, she's different from me]

226
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:40,640
The main difference between Alice
and me is that

227
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,850
Alice's world

228
00:08:42,010 --> 00:08:43,919
