229
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:46,470
She smiles at everyone.

230
00:08:46,470 --> 00:08:48,600
She is optimistic and positive.

231
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:50,790
She likes to help others
and is very compassionate.

232
00:08:50,790 --> 00:08:52,870
She doesn't know how to refuse others.

233
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:55,370
You can probably tell by now

234
00:08:55,370 --> 00:08:56,900
that she's nothing like me.

235
00:08:57,170 --> 00:09:00,240
That is to say, my personality

236
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,640
