249
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:29,370
I feel things just as deeply,
but I keep them to myself.

250
00:09:29,370 --> 00:09:30,430
-Yeah.
-That's it.

251
00:09:30,430 --> 00:09:32,360
So this is probably similar.

252
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:35,200
As for me and Nannalin,

253
00:09:35,650 --> 00:09:37,690
there are many differences.

254
00:09:37,690 --> 00:09:38,960
Nannalin is

255
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:42,690
hard-headed,
can't stand being alone, willful,

256
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:40,790
[Hard-headed]

257
00:09:40,790 --> 00:09:41,600
[Can't stand being alone]

258
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:42,880
[Willful]

259
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,610
bad-tempered,

260
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,610
[Bad-tempered]

261
00:09:44,610 --> 00:09:47,230
and sharp-tongued.

262
00:09:45,490 --> 00:09:46,810
[Sharp-tongued]

263
